@startuml
' Supporting document: ../references/examples.md#interaction-and-lifecycle-late-payment-authorization
' Scope: one authorization response, atomic confirmation, and late-authorization remedy. Designation: proposed-design, teaching only.
title Revision: atomic confirmation can refuse late payment
participant Checkout
participant PaymentGateway
participant Reservation
Checkout -> PaymentGateway : authorize()
PaymentGateway --> Checkout : paymentAuthorized
Checkout -> Reservation : confirmIfHeld(paymentAuthorized)
note right of Reservation
  Atomic transition only while Held.
  Expiry can win before this request.
end note
alt confirmation succeeds (Held -> Confirmed)
  Reservation --> Checkout : confirmed
else confirmation refused (Expired stays Expired)
  Reservation --> Checkout : expired
  Checkout -> PaymentGateway : voidAuthorization()
end
@enduml
